{"title":"따봉으로 레벨업","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=eGXUy/hAd4HdGV2e/yoNckKkUUlvfyEZyo2SUe1&filename=th3","synopsis":"내 이름은 엄 지척(志剔).\n대한민국 평범한 헌터 보조원.\n몬스터 사체를 처리하며 근근이 살아가고 있다.\n\n그런 어느 날, 돌아가신 할아버지가 꿈에 나타난 이후, \n\n'따봉을 받고, 각성해 버렸다.'\n\n할아버지, 이래서 손자 이름을 이렇게 지으신 건가요? \n따봉이 포인트가 된다! \n따봉을 모아 스킬을 구매하고 레벨업한다.\n\n'전무후무 각성자'\n따봉으로 강해지는 최강헌터 엄지척의 이야기!\n\n\n**********************\n빅라이트작가님의 원작 소설 본격 웹툰화!!\n**********************","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":295,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":286,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":287,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":299,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":291,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-10-21","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-23","rank":298,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-29","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-30","rank":281,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}}],"weekly":[],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-11","v":2631546,"rc":10197,"rs":98670,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":2631584,"rc":10197,"rs":98670,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":2631614,"rc":10198,"rs":98680,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":2631645,"rc":10198,"rs":98680,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":2631681,"rc":10198,"rs":98680,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":2631719,"rc":10200,"rs":98700,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":2631745,"rc":10201,"rs":98710,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":2631773,"rc":10203,"rs":98730,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":2631798,"rc":10203,"rs":98730,"cc":3340},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":2631920,"rc":10206,"rs"